{% comment %}
=====================================================================
 05 · Post-Purchase · snippets.liquid
 Campaign: TRX_ORDER_CONFIRMATION (API-triggered, transactional)
 Canvas:   CANVAS | Post-Purchase | v1
 Brand:    Northwind Supply Co. (fictional)

 Where data comes from
 - TRX_ORDER_CONFIRMATION: {{api_trigger_properties.${name}}}, sent
   by the order system in the /campaigns/trigger/send call.
 - Canvas steps: {{canvas_entry_properties.${name}}} from the purchase
   that caused entry (order-level properties ride on every line).
 - Cross-sell: Connected Content to the recommendations API with the
   stored credential `northwind_recs_api`, static fallback on failure.
=====================================================================
{% endcomment %}


{% comment %} ============= BEGIN TRX_ORDER_CONFIRMATION ==============
 Transactional · immediately · Email · separate API-triggered campaign
 Subject:   Order {{order_number}} confirmed
            (subject-field Liquid:
             Order {{api_trigger_properties.${order_number} | default: ''}} confirmed)
 Preheader: Thanks for your order. Here are the details.
 Transactional rules: no promotions, no cross-sell, no control group.
 Aborts without an order number: a confirmation that cannot say which
 order it confirms creates support tickets instead of preventing them.
{% endcomment %}
{%- assign order_number = api_trigger_properties.${order_number} | strip -%}
{%- if order_number == blank -%}
  {% abort_message('TRX_ORDER_CONFIRMATION: order_number missing') %}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign lines = api_trigger_properties.${items} -%}
{%- if lines == blank or lines.size == 0 -%}
  {% abort_message('TRX_ORDER_CONFIRMATION: no line items') %}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign fname = ${first_name} | strip | default: 'there' -%}
{{content_blocks.${CB_TRX_HEADER}}}
<h1>Thanks, {{fname}}. Your order is confirmed.</h1>
<p>Order number: <strong>{{order_number | escape}}</strong></p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
{%- for line in lines %}
  <tr>
    <td>{{line.name | strip | default: 'Item' | escape}} &times; {{line.quantity | default: 1}}</td>
    <td align="right">{{line.line_total_display | default: ''}}</td>
  </tr>
{%- endfor %}
</table>
{%- if api_trigger_properties.${total_display} != blank %}
<p>Total: <strong>{{api_trigger_properties.${total_display}}}</strong></p>
{%- endif %}
{%- if api_trigger_properties.${ship_to_summary} != blank %}
<p>Shipping to: {{api_trigger_properties.${ship_to_summary} | escape}}</p>
{%- endif %}
<p>Estimated delivery: {{api_trigger_properties.${delivery_estimate_display} | default: 'we will email you when it ships'}}</p>
<p><a href="https://www.example.com/account/orders/{{order_number | url_encode}}">View your order</a></p>
{{content_blocks.${CB_TRX_FOOTER}}}
{% comment %} ============== END TRX_ORDER_CONFIRMATION =============== {% endcomment %}


{% comment %} ============== BEGIN UPD_POSTPURCH_FLAGS ================
 Canvas · first step after control split · User Update · Advanced JSON
 Copies entry properties onto the profile so later Decision Splits and
 step 4A can use them. Paste the JSON only.
{% endcomment %}
{"attributes": [{"last_order_has_consumable": {% if canvas_entry_properties.${has_consumable} == true %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}, "postpurch_entry_order_at": "{{canvas_entry_properties.${ordered_at} | default: 'now' | date: '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ'}}"}]}
{% comment %} =============== END UPD_POSTPURCH_FLAGS ================= {% endcomment %}


{% comment %} ================ BEGIN EM_POSTPURCH_S1 =================
 Step 1 · T+2d · Email · shipping status + how to get the most from it
 Subject:   Getting ready for your Northwind order
 Preheader: Setup tips and care guides for what you bought.
 Uses the first item's catalog care guide; falls back to the general
 help center. No selling in this email.
{% endcomment %}
{%- assign lines = canvas_entry_properties.${items} -%}
{%- if lines == blank or lines.size == 0 -%}
  {% abort_message('EM_POSTPURCH_S1: no items in entry properties') %}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign order_at = canvas_entry_properties.${ordered_at} | default: 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0 -%}
{%- assign delivered_at = custom_attribute.${last_delivery_confirmed_at} | default: '1970-01-01T00:00:00Z' | date: '%s' | plus: 0 -%}
{%- assign fname = ${first_name} | strip | default: 'there' -%}
{{content_blocks.${CB_GLOBAL_HEADER}}}
{%- if delivered_at > order_at %}
<h1>It's arrived, {{fname}}. Here's how to get started.</h1>
{%- else %}
<h1>Your order is on its way, {{fname}}.</h1>
<p>You'll get a tracking email from our shipping partner. In the meantime, here's how to get the most out of what you bought.</p>
{%- endif %}
<ul>
{%- for line in lines limit: 4 -%}
  {%- assign pid = line.product_id | strip -%}
  {%- assign guide = '' -%}
  {%- if pid != blank -%}
    {% catalog_items products {{pid}} %}
    {%- assign guide = items[0].care_guide_url | strip | default: '' -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if guide == blank -%}{%- assign guide = 'https://www.example.com/help' -%}{%- endif %}
  <li><a href="{{guide}}?utm_source=braze&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=EM_POSTPURCH_S1">{{line.name | strip | default: 'Your item' | escape}}: setup and care guide</a></li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
{{content_blocks.${CB_POSTPURCH_SUPPORT}}}
{{content_blocks.${CB_GLOBAL_FOOTER}}}
{% comment %} ================= END EM_POSTPURCH_S1 ================== {% endcomment %}


{% comment %} ================ BEGIN EM_POSTPURCH_S2 =================
 Step 2 · delivery + 5d (else T+10d) · Email · review request
 Subject:   How's it working out?
 Preheader: Tap a star. It takes ten seconds.
 One review link per item, maximum 4. No incentive for reviewing.
 Aborts if a return or ticket opened between the split and the send.
{% endcomment %}
{%- if custom_attribute.${has_open_return} == true or custom_attribute.${has_open_support_ticket} == true -%}
  {% abort_message('EM_POSTPURCH_S2: open return or support ticket') %}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign lines = canvas_entry_properties.${items} -%}
{%- assign order_id = canvas_entry_properties.${order_id} | strip -%}
{%- if lines == blank or lines.size == 0 or order_id == blank -%}
  {% abort_message('EM_POSTPURCH_S2: items or order_id missing') %}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign fname = ${first_name} | strip | default: 'there' -%}
{{content_blocks.${CB_GLOBAL_HEADER}}}
<h1>{{fname}}, how's it working out?</h1>
<p>Your review helps other people pick the right gear, and it tells us what to fix. Tap a star to start.</p>
{%- for line in lines limit: 4 -%}
{%- assign pid = line.product_id | strip -%}
{%- if pid != blank %}
<p><strong>{{line.name | strip | default: 'Your item' | escape}}</strong><br>
{%- for star in (1..5) -%}
<a href="https://www.example.com/review/{{pid | url_encode}}?order={{order_id | url_encode}}&amp;rating={{star}}&amp;utm_source=braze&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=EM_POSTPURCH_S2" style="font-size:28px;text-decoration:none;color:#f5a623;" aria-label="{{star}} out of 5 stars">&#9733;</a>
{%- endfor -%}
</p>
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor %}
<p>Something not right? <a href="https://www.example.com/help/contact?order={{order_id | url_encode}}">Tell our support team</a> and we'll sort it out.</p>
{{content_blocks.${CB_GLOBAL_FOOTER}}}
{% comment %} ================= END EM_POSTPURCH_S2 ================== {% endcomment %}


{% comment %} ================ BEGIN EM_POSTPURCH_S3 =================
 Step 3 · about T+21d · Email · cross-sell via Connected Content
 Subject:   Goes well with your {{first item}}
            (subject-field Liquid:
             Goes well with your {{canvas_entry_properties.${items}[0].name | strip | default: 'recent order'}})
 Preheader: Picked to pair with what you already have.
 Max 3 products. Purchased items are excluded in the API call AND
 filtered again here. Any API failure renders the static fallback.
{% endcomment %}
{%- assign lines = canvas_entry_properties.${items} -%}
{%- assign exclude_list = lines | map: 'product_id' -%}
{%- assign exclude_param = exclude_list | join: ',' | url_encode -%}
{% connected_content https://api.example.com/v1/recommendations?user={{${user_id} | url_encode}}&exclude={{exclude_param}}&limit=6 :method get :basic_auth northwind_recs_api :content_type application/json :cache_max_age 900 :retry :save recs %}
{%- assign shown = 0 -%}
{%- assign fname = ${first_name} | strip | default: 'there' -%}
{{content_blocks.${CB_GLOBAL_HEADER}}}
<h1>{{fname}}, these pair well with your last order.</h1>
{%- if recs.__http_status_code__ == 200 and recs.products != nil and recs.products.size > 0 %}
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr>
{%- for p in recs.products -%}
  {%- if shown < 3 and p.product_id != blank and p.url != blank -%}
    {%- unless exclude_list contains p.product_id -%}
      {%- assign shown = shown | plus: 1 %}
  <td width="33%" valign="top" style="padding:8px;">
    <a href="{{p.url}}?utm_source=braze&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=EM_POSTPURCH_S3">{%- if p.image_url != blank -%}<img src="{{p.image_url}}" alt="{{p.name | strip | default: 'Recommended item' | escape}}" width="160" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;">{%- endif -%}</a>
    <p><strong>{{p.name | strip | default: 'Recommended for you' | escape}}</strong>{% if p.price_display != blank %}<br>{{p.price_display}}{% endif %}</p>
  </td>
    {%- endunless -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor %}
</tr></table>
{%- endif %}
{%- if shown == 0 %}
{{content_blocks.${CB_POSTPURCH_CROSSSELL_FALLBACK}}}
{%- endif %}
{{content_blocks.${CB_GLOBAL_FOOTER}}}
{% comment %} ================= END EM_POSTPURCH_S3 ================== {% endcomment %}


{% comment %} ================ BEGIN EM_POSTPURCH_S4A ================
 Step 4A · about T+45d · Email · replenishment (consumables)
 Subject:   Running low?
 Preheader: Reorder in one click, same as last time.
 Aborts if the customer has reordered since this canvas started, or
 if the order had no consumable lines to show.
{% endcomment %}
{%- assign entry_at = custom_attribute.${postpurch_entry_order_at} | default: 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0 -%}
{%- assign last_order = custom_attribute.${last_order_at} | default: '1970-01-01T00:00:00Z' | date: '%s' | plus: 0 -%}
{%- assign cutoff = entry_at | plus: 86400 -%}
{%- if last_order > cutoff -%}
  {% abort_message('EM_POSTPURCH_S4A: customer already reordered') %}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign lines = canvas_entry_properties.${items} -%}
{%- assign consumables = 0 -%}
{%- for line in lines -%}{%- if line.is_consumable == true -%}{%- assign consumables = consumables | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
{%- if consumables == 0 -%}
  {% abort_message('EM_POSTPURCH_S4A: no consumable lines') %}
{%- endif -%}
{%- assign order_id = canvas_entry_properties.${order_id} | strip -%}
{%- assign fname = ${first_name} | strip | default: 'there' -%}
{{content_blocks.${CB_GLOBAL_HEADER}}}
<h1>{{fname}}, time to restock?</h1>
<p>Based on your last order, you might be getting low on:</p>
<ul>
{%- for line in lines -%}
{%- if line.is_consumable == true %}
  <li>{{line.name | strip | default: 'Your item' | escape}}</li>
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- if order_id != blank %}
<p><a href="https://www.example.com/reorder?order={{order_id | url_encode}}&amp;utm_source=braze&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=EM_POSTPURCH_S4A" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;background:#1f3a5f;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;">Reorder these items</a></p>
{%- else %}
<p><a href="https://www.example.com/account/orders?utm_source=braze&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=EM_POSTPURCH_S4A">See your past orders</a></p>
{%- endif %}
{{content_blocks.${CB_GLOBAL_FOOTER}}}
{% comment %} ================= END EM_POSTPURCH_S4A ================= {% endcomment %}


{% comment %} ================ BEGIN EM_POSTPURCH_S4B ================
 Step 4B · about T+45d · Email · next-category nudge (durables)
 Subject:   The next piece of your kit
 Preheader: What people add after the {{first item}}.
 Uses the first item's category to pick a curated content block
 (CB_POSTPURCH_NEXT_<CATEGORY>), falling back to a general block.
{% endcomment %}
{%- assign lines = canvas_entry_properties.${items} -%}
{%- assign cat = lines[0].category | strip | upcase | replace: ' ', '_' | replace: '-', '_' | default: '' -%}
{%- assign fname = ${first_name} | strip | default: 'there' -%}
{{content_blocks.${CB_GLOBAL_HEADER}}}
<h1>{{fname}}, here's what usually comes next.</h1>
{%- case cat -%}
  {%- when 'CAMPING' -%}
{{content_blocks.${CB_POSTPURCH_NEXT_CAMPING}}}
  {%- when 'CLIMBING' -%}
{{content_blocks.${CB_POSTPURCH_NEXT_CLIMBING}}}
  {%- when 'APPAREL' -%}
{{content_blocks.${CB_POSTPURCH_NEXT_APPAREL}}}
  {%- else -%}
{{content_blocks.${CB_POSTPURCH_NEXT_CATEGORY_FALLBACK}}}
{%- endcase %}
{{content_blocks.${CB_GLOBAL_FOOTER}}}
{% comment %} ================= END EM_POSTPURCH_S4B ================= {% endcomment %}
